      "description": "A bordered, tonal supporting panel used for independent focus.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-label\">Independent focus</div><h3 class=\"ds-panel-title\">Work on your own.</h3><p class=\"ds-panel-copy\">Focus sessions will be available here when FlowState is connected.</p></section>",
